recursive-include neuralops *.json

prune tests
prune benchmarks
prune evaluation
prune scripts
prune results
prune paper
prune thesis_final
prune docs
prune academic
prune logs
prune _archive
prune neuralops/_archive
prune neuralops/core/_archive
prune neuralops/attentions/_legacy
prune neuralops/compression_engine/_legacy
prune neuralops/data/glue_data

prune build
prune dist
prune .pytest_cache
prune .ruff_cache
prune .mypy_cache
prune .nox
prune .tox
prune htmlcov

